message: "If you use DSFB-Chemical-Engineering, please cite the following."
title: "DSFB-Chemical-Engineering: Read-Only Residual Semiotics for Chemometrics-Augmented Fault Detection and Diagnosis in Chemical Engineering, with a Deterministic, Byte-Exact, CUDA-Accelerated Forensic Evidence Court"
type: software
version: "1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20443279"
date-released: 2026-05-23
